* hand-written deck (textbook topology), not exported from any drawing
.title Emitter follower driving a common-emitter stage
.global VCC
.subckt CcCe in out
.iodir in=input out=output
.name in V_in
.name out V_out
Q1 VCC in x npn
.name Q1 Q_1
I1 x 0
.name I1 I_1
RC VCC out
.name RC R_C
Q2 out x 0 npn
.name Q2 Q_2
.ends
